<span id="A2.T2.2.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">The <span id="A2.T2.2.4.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">ball</span> is in box A and the <span id="A2.T2.2.4.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">pen</span> is in box Q. Which box is the <span id="A2.T2.2.4.3.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ball</span> in?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T2.2.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">A<math id="A2.T2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math>A 
<br class="ltx_break">Q<math id="A2.T2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math>Q</td>
<td id="A2.T2.2.4.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">
<span id="A2.T2.2.4.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T2.2.4.5.1.1" class="ltx_p">A: Patched tokens encode lexical binding used by the model 
<br class="ltx_break">Q: Patched tokens do not encode lexical binding used by the model</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T2.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
