<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 23: </span>Mean logit distributions under <span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.F23.pic2" class="ltx_picture" height="15.68" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:-5.15px" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 94.09 15.68" width="94.09"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,15.68) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#BFBFBF;" fill="#BFBFBF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.84 L 0 10.84 C 0 13.51 2.17 15.68 4.84 15.68 L 89.25 15.68 C 91.92 15.68 94.09 13.51 94.09 10.84 L 94.09 4.84 C 94.09 2.17 91.92 0 89.25 0 L 4.84 0 C 2.17 0 0 2.17 0 4.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#ECECEC;" fill="#ECECEC" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 4.84 L 0.69 10.84 C 0.69 13.13 2.55 14.99 4.84 14.99 L 89.25 14.99 C 91.54 14.99 93.4 13.13 93.4 10.84 L 93.4 4.84 C 93.4 2.55 91.54 0.69 89.25 0.69 L 4.84 0.69 C 2.55 0.69 0.69 2.55 0.69 4.84 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 3.46 5.15)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:6em;--ltx-fo-height:0.58em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.21em;font-size:10.5pt;" height="11.53" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.46)" width="87.17"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A3.F23.pic2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">TargetRebind</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span> for qwen2.5-7b-it on the <span id="A3.F23.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">sports</span> task. Left: fixing <math id="A3.F23.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i_{L}=8,i_{R}=16" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i_{L}=8,i_{R}=16</annotation></semantics></math> and varying <math id="A3.F23.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i_{P}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i_{P}</annotation></semantics></math>. Right: fixing <math id="A3.F23.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i_{P}=8,i_{L}=19" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i_{P}=8,i_{L}=19</annotation></semantics></math> and varying <math id="A3.F23.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i_{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i_{R}</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
